=\"message\"><br /> Amazingly... <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mFwCcIzeJD8\" target=\"_blank\">deadly!</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Here where I live, the only death by an animal we ever had in the zoo was by otters. There's a memorial at their den, a child entered it and a firefighter went in to get them out. The firefighter died horribly, after 3 days at the hospital, between he entering and zookeepers rescuing him he got more than 100 bites from them eating him alive.<br /> <br /> You can search &quot;zool\u00f3gico de Bras\u00edlia ariranha mata bombeiro&quot;, or &quot;Brasilia zoo otters kill firefighter&quot;. With luck you'll find something indexed on your local search.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-08-23T17:05:32-07:00","id":1563386,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cross-a-way</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1559441-does-anyone-have-a-copy-of-otterpooka-s-ahuizotl#post1559441\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As the title says, I am looking to see if anyone has a copy of Otterpooka's Homebrew